{title: Deva Shree Ganesha}
{artist: Ajay Atul Agnipath}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Jwaala si jalti hai
[C#]aankhon mein jiske bhi
[A#m]Dil mein [C]tera naam hai
[C]Parwaah hi kya uska
[C#]aarambh kaisa hai
[A#m]aur kaisa [C]parinaam hai
[F]Dharti ambar sitaare hai
[F]Uski [C#]nazarein utaarein
[F]Darr bhi uss se dara re
[F]Jiski [C#]rakhwaliya re
[D#]Karta [A#m]saaya tera
[C]Deva [A#m]Shree [C]Ganesha (x8)
[C]Ho..Teri [C#]bhakti to [C]vardaan hai
[C]Jo [C#]kamaaye woh [C]dhanwaan hai
[F]Bin kinare ki [D#]kashti hai woh
[D#]Deva, [A#m]Tujhse jo [C#]anjaan hai
[C]Yun [C#]tto mooshak [C]sawaari teri
[C]Sab [C#]pe hai [C]pehredaari teri
[F]Paap ki [D#]aandhiyaan laakh ho
[D#]Kabhi [A#m]jyoti na [C#]haari teri
[F]Apni taqdeer ka woh,
[F]khud sikander [C#]huaa re
[F]Bhool ke yeh jahaan re
[F]Jis kisi [C#]ne yahaan re
[D#]Saath [A#m]paaya tera..
